            "title": "TAKE CARE",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>Our industry is the second largest polluter in the world. Not only are we contaminating our planet and jeopardizing a safe and greener future, the industry is one of the main reasons behind poor and unfair working conditions for millions of people.</p>",
